Nodes 64
Tiers 2
Podsize 64

# Eight leaf switches, each with eight directly attached RNIC nodes and one
# 40-Gbit/s uplink to each of the eight spine switches.
Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 40
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 8
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0

# Eight spine switches, each with one 40-Gbit/s link to every leaf.
Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 40
Radix_Down 8
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
